~ sewers
do freezePlayer()
*Its a massive hole. Below is some dark tunnels, could be handy for a quick escape*
Queen: wait- I
do spawn_npc("res://resources/scenes/objects/NPCs/Scarlet.tscn", player.global_position.x, player.global_position.y)
do player.visible = false
do player.reparent(get_npc("scarlet"))
do get_npc("scarlet").walk_to(Vector2(player.global_position.x,player.global_position.y - 30))
do playAnimation("fade", cutscene_player, false)
do wait(1)
do cutscene_player.play("rush")
do cutscene_player_2.play("fall")
do wait(3)
do unfreezePlayer()
do transitionRoom("Sewers", "SPAWNER")
=> END

~ hungerpains
do playSound("res://resources/sfx/cutscenes/common/pixabay/stomach_growl.mp3")
do freezePlayer()
Queen: There is a short time before we can start, in the meantime find yourself food and a place to stay. 
Queen: I'd start with food, you seem quite hungry.
do unfreezePlayer()
=> END
~ stomachgrowl
do playSound("res://resources/sfx/cutscenes/common/pixabay/stomach_growl.mp3")
=> END